GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/flamegraph?
    start_datetime=2023-01-25T00:00:00&
    end_datetime=2023-01-26T06:00:00&
    format=collapsed_file&
    stacks_num=10000&
    client=354&
    service=647163&
    metadata=full&
    enrichment=lang

### Additional metrics: names available for a service in the time range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/metrics/ext/names?
    start_datetime=2026-11-14T00:00:00&
    end_datetime=2026-11-17T00:00:00&
    service=1

### Additional metrics: one metric over time, aggregated across hosts (avg / max / percentile)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/metrics/ext/graph?
    start_datetime=2026-11-14T00:00:00&
    end_datetime=2026-11-17T00:00:00&
    service=1&
    name=psi.cpu.some&
    percentile=90&
    interval=1%20hour&
    hostname=my-host
